<p>Hi,</p>
<p>An account requested the Enterprise plan on your NewRelay instance.</p>
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="margin: 8px 0 16px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 9px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #334155;">Account</td>
    <td align="right" style="padding: 9px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #0F172A;">{{ meta.account_name }} (#{{ meta.account_id }})</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 9px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #334155;">Requested by</td>
    <td align="right" style="padding: 9px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #0F172A;">{{ meta.requested_by_name }}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 9px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #334155;">Company size</td>
    <td align="right" style="padding: 9px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #0F172A;">{{ meta.company_size }}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="padding: 9px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #334155;">Seats needed</td>
    <td align="right" style="padding: 9px 0; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #0F172A;">{{ meta.team_size }}</td>
  </tr>
</table>
<p><strong>Features of interest</strong></p>
<p>
  {% if meta.desired_features.size > 0 %}
    {% for feature in meta.desired_features %}{{ feature }}{% unless forloop.last %}, {% endunless %}{% endfor %}
  {% else %}
    None specified
  {% endif %}
</p>
<p><strong>Additional details</strong></p>
<p>{{ meta.message }}</p>
<p>Follow up from Super Admin → Enterprise Contracts.</p>
